ass=\"language-math math-inline\">0 + 2 = 2</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">2</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Borromean <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">L_{6a4}</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\zeta_4 = i</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbb{Q}(i)</code></td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(0, 1)</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">1</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">1</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Whitehead</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\zeta_4 = i</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbb{Q}(i)</code></td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(0, 1)</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">1</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">1</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>trefoil <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">3_1 = T(2,3)</code></td>\n<td>(degenerate, not hyperbolic)</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbb{Q}(\\zeta_6)</code> ambient</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(0, 1)</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">1</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">1</code> (CS-class)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bring quintic root</td>\n<td>root of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">x^5 - 5x - 1</code></td>\n<td>totally real degree-5</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(5, 0)</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">5 + 0 = 5</code></td>\n<td><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">0</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/appendix-surreals/borel-partial-resolution-table1-data.md","heading":"Table"}
